+#### Push notifications
+
+Fizzy can send web push notifications to phones and desktops, so people get the same notifications on their devices as they do in the app's notification tray.
+To enable push notifications, you need to generate a VAPID key pair and provide it to Fizzy:
+
+```sh
+bin/rails runner 'key = WebPush.generate_key; puts "VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=#{key.public_key}"; puts "VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY=#{key.private_key}"'
+```
+
+Set the resulting `VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY` and `VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY` environment variables on your container.
+Without them, Fizzy can't deliver push notifications.
+
 #### Base URL
 
 Fizzy needs to know the public URL of your instance so it can generate correct links in certain situations (like when sending emails).
